config LEDS_SC2720_KPLED_UMS9117
	bool "SC2720 keypad backlight on UMS9117"
	depends on ARCH_UMS9117
	depends on LEDS_CLASS && INPUT && OF
	help
	  Control the SC2720 keypad current-sink output through the shared
	  UMS9117 analog-die interface. The board selects the current code
	  and physical keypad. Key presses light the binary LED class device
	  for about five seconds.
